<title>THAILAND: Krung Thai Bank unit holds stake in firm.</title>
<headline>Krung Thai Bank unit holds stake in firm.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krung Thai Bank Plc said on Friday that its subsidiary Krung Thai Holding Co Ltd would hold a 45 percent stake in a newly established insurance firm.</p>
<p>The bank said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand that Krung Thai Holding would invest 225 million baht ($8.65 million) in Agza Insurance Co Ltd which earlier this week won one of the 28 new insurance licences granted by the government.</p>
<p>(US$1 = 26 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
